// What the creature type confers [CR#508.1a]: its object is a Combatant, so
// the creature-like combat rules apply to it [CR#120.3e,302.6,509.1a]. A
// quality, not an ability [CR#113.12], so the ability-free `Property` flavor.
(
    name: "combatant",
    kinds: [Conferral],
    params: [],
    body: Property(spec: Combatant(subject: This)),
)
